:INFO
Art. 13a Information provided to the FDPIC by the authority
(Art. 15 and 16 FoIA)
The administrative units of the Central Federal Administration shall provide the FDPIC with a copy of their ruling and any decisions made by the appeal instances.
|

:NOTE
Art. 13a — Inserted by No I of the O of 20 April 2011 (AS 2011 1741). Amended by Annex 2 No II 13 of the Data Protection Ordinance of 31 Aug. 2022, in force since 1 Sept. 2023 (AS 2022 568).

